          "source_id": "s-nanqishu-045-daosheng-complete-ws2273185",
          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-045-daosheng-complete:p011",
          "quote": "　　詔斂葬遙光屍，原其諸子。追贈桑天愛輔國將軍、梁州刺史。以江陵公寶覽爲始安王，奉靖王後。永元二年，爲持節、督湘州、輔國將軍、湘州刺史。",
          "person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-045-daosheng-complete:p011:m0030"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
